  "body": "This is family living done properly.\r\n\r\nElevated in sought-after Long Bay, this striking five-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom home combines space, style and a layout designed for real family life.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the contemporary architecture and impressive street presence set the tone. Step inside and you're welcomed by light-filled, open-plan living connecting the modern kitchen, dining and family areas, then flowing effortlessly onto expansive wrap-around decking and covered outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautifully appointed kitchen with a generous butler's pantry, while multiple living areas give everyone their own space, whether you're entertaining friends, relaxing as a family or simply escaping the noise.\r\n\r\nWith five generous bedrooms, there's flexibility for every stage of family life. The ground-floor bedroom with its own ensuite is ideal for grandparents, extended family, teenagers or guests.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master suite is a genuine retreat, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and an impressively spacious ensuite featuring a double vanity and bathtub.\r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced section offers a secure space for children and pets, while the double internal-access garage adds the practicality every busy household needs.\r\n\r\nAnd the location makes everyday life easy. Walk to Ashley Park, Long Bay Primary and Long Bay College, with Long Bay Village, cafés, shops and beautiful Long Bay Regional Park just minutes away.\r\n\r\nWhat you'll love:\r\n- 5 generous bedrooms\r\n- 3.5 bathrooms\r\n- Ground-floor guest bedroom with ensuite\r\n- Impressive master suite with walk-in wardrobe\r\n- Large master ensuite with double vanity and bathtub\r\n- Modern kitchen with butler's pantry\r\n- Multiple light-filled living areas\r\n- Expansive wrap-around decking\r\n- Covered outdoor entertaining\r\n- Fully fenced section\r\n- Double internal-access garage\r\n- Elevated urban outlook\r\n- Excellent Long Bay location\r\n\r\nThe owners are ready for their next chapter. The opportunity is yours.\r\n\r\nCome through, picture yourself here and make your offer.",
